{"id":"n26318-2-7","stage":3,"title":"부서지다 · 散开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26318-2-7-1","ko":"하얗게 부서지는 파도를 보니 마음이 시원해지네.","zh":"看着那层层破碎的白色海浪，心里真觉得舒畅啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하얗게","meaning":"白","explanation":"하얗다：白；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하얗다","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73274","senseId":"1","lemma":"하얗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하얗게","audio":"/audio/5fa0f47fd28fa1e8bf14.mp3"}},{"text":"부서지는","meaning":"散开，飞溅","explanation":"부서지다：散开，飞溅；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"부서지다","audio":"/audio/1adedab084e1d1b96c5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26318","senseId":"2","lemma":"부서지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부서지는","audio":"/audio/7e7db02047182dc2bda2.mp3"}},{"text":"파도를","meaning":"波涛，浪涛，波浪","explanation":"파도：波涛，浪涛，波浪；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"파도","audio":"/audio/280865cc3d3f77a4628d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71304","senseId":"1","lemma":"파도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파도를","audio":"/audio/52a37dbf0493e82657f3.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음이","audio":"/audio/82961fdb31e01cd27c53.mp3"}},{"text":"시원해지네.","meaning":"舒畅，舒服；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"시원하다：舒畅，舒服；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"7","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원해지네","audio":"/audio/51dc6b204f128b3aaf44.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"77a80be38f1ae80d","term":"하얗다","zh":"白","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3","entryId":"73274","definition":"和雪或牛奶一样白得鲜明。","pronunciation":["하ː야타"]},{"id":"1adedab084e1d1b9","term":"부서지다","zh":"散开，飞溅","audio":"/audio/1adedab084e1d1b96c5c.mp3","entryId":"26318","definition":"浪或光等碰撞后向周围扩展、发散。","pronunciation":["부서지다"]},{"id":"280865cc3d3f77a4","term":"파도","zh":"波涛，浪涛，波浪","audio":"/audio/280865cc3d3f77a4628d.mp3","entryId":"71304","definition":"海上掀起的水波。","pronunciation":["파도"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"舒畅，舒服","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"郁闷的心情得到缓解，轻松痛快。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ab575aa46c1cc8c82e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26318-2-7-2","ko":"바다에 놀러 오길 잘했지?","zh":"能来海边玩，真是做对了决定吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바다에","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다에","audio":"/audio/f90059be936edf357e9a.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"오길","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오길","audio":"/audio/cdcb259c9c5e764129bb.mp3"}},{"text":"잘했지?","meaning":"好","explanation":"잘하다：好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘했지","audio":"/audio/c5acaaa5d96dfde1bd1d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1ea5c356f65344cf","term":"바다","zh":"海，大海，海洋","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3","entryId":"26497","definition":"在地球上除陆地以外被咸水填满的部分。","pronunciation":["바다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"好","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得正确合理。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/14a38c8e02a0875c0577.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.935,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26318","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":